WEBVTT

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:31.976
What it means is:
here is an idea or a notion

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:35.655
that you're not allowed
to say anything bad about.

00:08:35.679 --> 00:08:39.976
You're just not. Why not?
Because you're not."

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:43.904
(Laughter)

00:08:43.928 --> 00:08:46.349
"Why should it be
that it's perfectly legitimate

00:08:46.373 --> 00:08:48.362
to support the Republicans or Democrats,

00:08:48.386 --> 00:08:50.746
this model of economics versus that,

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:52.735
Macintosh instead of Windows,

00:08:52.759 --> 00:08:55.720
but to have an opinion
about how the universe began,

00:08:55.744 --> 00:08:57.380
about who created the universe --

00:08:57.404 --> 00:08:59.053
no, that's holy.

00:08:59.784 --> 00:09:03.150
So, we're used to not
challenging religious ideas,